Data.DatabaseSchemes:
CREATE TABLE EvaluationCriteria (
    criterion_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    weight DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE VendorScores (
    vendor_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    criterion_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    score DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL,
    PRIMARY KEY (vendor_id, criterion_id)
);

CREATE TABLE TCOAnalysis (
    tco_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY,
    vendor_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    cost_category VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    amount DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL
);

Storage Tech Summary: Relational database (e.g., PostgreSQL) for structured evaluation data, ensuring ACID compliance and referential integrity.
